WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.501 --> 00:00:04.379
We do not know when it will be
safe to go outside.

00:00:06.006 --> 00:00:08.633
We only know that day is not today.

00:00:10.093 --> 00:00:13.263
We're in a silo. Ten thousand
people, one hundred forty-four floors.

00:00:14.264 --> 00:00:16.933
There's a threat outside and we
don't know what the threat is.

00:00:18.351 --> 00:00:21.730
And characters ask the dangerous
questions of why.

00:00:23.314 --> 00:00:25.859
The show, at its core, is a mystery.

00:00:26.401 --> 00:00:31.031
It deals with what is the truth,
who owns the truth, and who is
telling the truth.

00:00:31.489 --> 00:00:35.076
Some mysteries are best left unsolved.

00:00:35.952 --> 00:00:38.246
Juliette is constantly seeking
the truth.

00:00:38.246 --> 00:00:40.832
The truth about the
bigger question of why we're there.

00:00:42.917 --> 00:00:47.047
Don't you ever think about the
world beyond the silo?

00:00:49.215 --> 00:00:52.969
There’s something going on and
that flame is picked up by Juliette.

00:00:52.969 --> 00:00:55.346
She wants to know, “What’s being
kept from us?”

00:00:55.930 --> 00:00:59.851
They want to erase the past and
anyone who tries to preserve it.

00:01:00.935 --> 00:01:05.273
Juliette finding out the truth
creates a domino effect into a
huge chaos.

00:01:05.273 --> 00:01:07.525
You need to stop doing what
you're doing.

00:01:07.525 --> 00:01:08.985
Not until I find out what I want
to know.

00:01:09.527 --> 00:01:10.695
They'll never let you.

00:01:11.279 --> 00:01:14.824
The wool is being pulled over
the people of the Silo's eyes.

00:01:15.784 --> 00:01:16.826
What is this place?

00:01:17.243 --> 00:01:18.828
We think it's from before the rebellion.

00:01:20.371 --> 00:01:23.500
Made me realize how
little we know about the Silo.

00:01:24.918 --> 00:01:31.382
The thing that’s really
satisfying is just how deep it runs.

00:01:33.426 --> 00:01:41.559
We do not know when it will be
safe to go outside. We only know
that day, is not this day.

00:01:42.894 --> 00:01:43.353
Now!

00:01:43.353 --> 00:01:46.606
And thereby, we remind you, that
here is safe-

00:01:48.441 --> 00:01:49.400
[screams]

00:01:49.984 --> 00:01:52.070
-and there is not.

